  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "The pattern followed here is:\n\nLet's check each option one by one:\n\n**Given: **7 and 4\n\n**Option 1) **4 - 7 + 6 ÷ 2 × 3 = 12\n\nAfter interchanging the number we get the;\n\n⇒ 7 - 4 + __**6 ÷ 2**__ × 3 = 12\n\n⇒ 7 - 4 + __**3 × 3**__ = 12\n\n⇒ __**7 **__- 4 __**+ 9**__ = 12\n\n⇒ 16 - 4 = 12\n\n⇒ 12 = 12\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\n**Option 2) **4 × 3 + 7 - 9 ÷ 3 = 20\n\nAfter interchanging the number we get the;\n\n⇒ 7 × 3 + 4 - __**9 ÷ 3 **__= 20\n\n⇒ __**7 × 3**__ + 4 - 3 = 20\n\n⇒ __**21 + 4**__ - 3 = 20\n\n⇒ 25 - 3 = 20\n\n⇒ 22 ≠ 20\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option 3) **7 + 4 × 2 - 6 ÷ 2 = 17\n\nAfter interchanging the number we get the;\n\n⇒ 4 + 7 × 2 - __**6 ÷ 2**__ = 17\n\n⇒ 4 + __**7 × 2 **__- 3 = 17\n\n⇒ __**4 + 14**__ - 3 = 17\n\n⇒ 18 - 3 = 17\n\n⇒ 15 ≠ 17\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option 4) **7 + 5 × 2 - 4 ÷ 1 = 9\n\nAfter interchanging the number we get the;\n\n⇒ 4 + 5 × 2 - __**7 ÷ 1**__ = 9\n\n⇒ 4 + __**5 × 2 **__- 7 = 9\n\n⇒ __**4 + 10**__ - 7 = 9\n\n⇒ __**14 - 7 **__= 9\n\n⇒ 7 ≠ 9\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 1\".**",
